    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Browser = RegisterPage + LoginPage + frontend authService + Axios. Public RegisterPage sends CUSTOMER; backend also handles COLLABORATOR and SHOP_MANAGER requests. Global DTO validation runs before controller methods.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2707,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "OTP verifies registration email, not a second login factor. It is held in a per-process Map for 5 minutes, removed after 5 wrong guesses or successful assertion. Resend replaces the cached code; the 60-second resend countdown is enforced by UI.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2757,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Expanded happy path is CUSTOMER. KOL requests create profile/tier lookup and Wallet; Shop requests create an inactive DRAFT Store while the User starts as CUSTOMER. These are separate writes, not a registration transaction; OTP is already consumed.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2812,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "MailService encapsulates Nodemailer SMTP. Missing configuration or ordinary send failure can fall back to console; success response is not proof of inbox delivery. Login alert is unawaited and never a blocking OTP challenge. No real email was sent for this diagram.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2867,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Existing-account login also accepts a uniquely resolved Vietnamese phone number. Invalid credentials: 401; disabled account: 403; invalid/expired OTP or DTO: 400; duplicate email: 409. JWT_SECRET is required; no refresh-token flow or login 2FA endpoint exists in the inspected auth code.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2922,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Protected routes use JwtAuthGuard + JwtStrategy to verify Bearer signature/expiry and reload active User; GET /api/auth/me returns safe account data. Those later calls, Google OAuth and password recovery are documented separately. Auto-login failure after registration returns UI to /login.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2977,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    }
